      "entries": [
        "The rivka lashes out with four of its razor-like claws. It makes four Strikes: the first at its highest attack bonus, the next two with a –4 penalty to their attack rolls, and the last one with a –8 penalty. This ability counts as four Strikes for the purpose of its multiple attack penalty."
      ],
      "requirements": "The rivka has not attacked yet this turn"
    },
